{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10212","headline":"赴南中留别褚七少府湖上林亭 · 李嘉佑","name":"赴南中留别褚七少府湖上林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种田东郭傍春陂，万事无情把钓丝。\n绿竹放侵行迳里，青山常对卷帘时。\n纷纷花发门空闭，寂寂莺啼日更迟。\n从此别君千万里，白云流水忆佳期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}